      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.55,
          "end": 5.16,
          "en": "-: Before we dive into optimizing lazy loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.16,
          "end": 7.17,
          "en": "let's add more lazy loading though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.17,
          "end": 10.26,
          "en": "Let's make sure we also lazy load the shopping-list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.26,
          "end": 12.03,
          "en": "and the auth module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.03,
          "end": 14.13,
          "en": "Of course, feel free to pause the video",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.13,
          "end": 15.9,
          "en": "at this point and do it on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.9,
          "end": 17.673,
          "en": "Thereafter, we'll do that together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.35,
          "end": 21.3,
          "en": "Were you successful?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.3,
          "end": 24.75,
          "en": "In the end, we just replicate what we did for recipes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.75,
          "end": 26.321,
          "en": "We add a new path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.321,
          "end": 28.481,
          "en": "shopping-list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.481,
          "end": 30.567,
          "en": "and there we add loadChildren",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.567,
          "end": 34.29,
          "en": "and we point at the shopping-list folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.29,
          "end": 38.1,
          "en": "and there at the shopping-list module without dot ts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.1,
          "end": 40.623,
          "en": "And thereafter with ShoppingListModule",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.91,
          "end": 44.64,
          "en": "or whatever you name the class in that file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.64,
          "end": 46.74,
          "en": "Now important, if we have a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.74,
          "end": 49.465,
          "en": "at that shopping list module here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.465,
          "end": 50.97,
          "en": "Whoops, this one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.97,
          "end": 53.58,
          "en": "Again, make sure you're using the right name here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.58,
          "end": 54.78,
          "en": "in your route config.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 54.78,
          "end": 57.408,
          "en": "And of course make sure that here you have a route set up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 57.408,
          "end": 60.33,
          "en": "where now you remove the path name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.33,
          "end": 64.38,
          "en": "and you have an empty path because the path name now went",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 64.38,
          "end": 68.403,
          "en": "into this global route config where we set up lazy loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.51,
          "end": 72.3,
          "en": "Now let's replicate the same for 'auth'.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 72.3,
          "end": 75.06,
          "en": "Therefore here the path should be auth.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 75.06,
          "end": 77.1,
          "en": "And then we again use loadChildren,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 77.1,
          "end": 78.93,
          "en": "we point at slash auth.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 78.93,
          "end": 81.66,
          "en": "Then at the auth.module without dot ts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 81.66,
          "end": 84.249,
          "en": "And then here at AuthModule,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 84.249,
          "end": 87.21000000000001,
          "en": "and again in the auth module file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 87.21000000000001,
          "end": 90.093,
          "en": "make sure the path is now just an empty path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 91.83,
          "end": 93.42,
          "en": "With all of that in place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 93.42,
          "end": 96.15,
          "en": "again, restart ng serve to be certain",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 96.15,
          "end": 98.4,
          "en": "that these changes are picked up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 98.4,
          "end": 99.99000000000001,
          "en": "Sometimes they can get lost",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 99.99000000000001,
          "end": 102.50999999999999,
          "en": "if you don't restart the build process.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 102.50999999999999,
          "end": 104.82,
          "en": "And therefore, now with that all reset",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 104.82,
          "end": 106.56,
          "en": "go back into the app module,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 106.56,
          "end": 108.92699999999999,
          "en": "and just as before make sure you remove",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 108.92699999999999,
          "end": 112.02000000000001,
          "en": "the AuthModule, anti-shopping list module here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 112.02000000000001,
          "end": 114.81,
          "en": "so that you're not eagerly loading that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 114.81,
          "end": 116.58,
          "en": "Also remove the imports.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 116.58,
          "end": 119.67,
          "en": "Save again to trigger a rebuild.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 119.67,
          "end": 121.2,
          "en": "And now let's wait",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 121.2,
          "end": 124.71,
          "en": "for that to reload here in the application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 124.71,
          "end": 126.09,
          "en": "This looks good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 126.09,
          "end": 128.67,
          "en": "Now you see that here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 128.67,
          "end": 130.95,
          "en": "the auth-auth-module was loaded for me,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 130.95,
          "end": 133.5,
          "en": "which is only 10 kilobytes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 133.5,
          "end": 137.94,
          "en": "The main module shrank to 54 kilobytes, which is great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 137.94,
          "end": 140.4,
          "en": "Even the vendor module shrank a bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 140.4,
          "end": 143.64,
          "en": "Because some parts we previously imported there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 143.64,
          "end": 145.74,
          "en": "are now only imported by modules.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 145.74,
          "end": 148.02,
          "en": "So some parts of the angular framework",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 148.02,
          "end": 150.96,
          "en": "like the forms module, are now only imported when",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 150.96,
          "end": 154.02,
          "en": "that component that uses it is imported.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 154.02,
          "end": 159.02,
          "en": "And therefore now when we do log in here, we go to recipes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 159.84,
          "end": 162.57,
          "en": "Now the recipes module is coming in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 162.57,
          "end": 164.91,
          "en": "Um, if you click on shopping list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 164.91,
          "end": 167.22,
          "en": "now the shopping list module is imported here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 167.22,
          "end": 168.84,
          "en": "you see these imports popping up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 168.84,
          "end": 171.84,
          "en": "on the right and that is lazy loading in action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 171.84,
          "end": 174.78,
          "en": "And even though the effect is not that large in this app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 174.78,
          "end": 175.92000000000002,
          "en": "we can see it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 175.92000000000002,
          "end": 177.32999999999998,
          "en": "And of course it becomes bigger",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 177.32999999999998,
          "end": 180.063,
          "en": "and bigger the bigger your application is.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
